"Business Day" means a day (other than a Saturday, Sunday, or public holiday) on which banks are open for general banking business in Sydney, New South Wales.

"Confidential Information" has the meaning given in clause 14.

"Field Manual" means AZEU's Field Operations Manual (version 4.2, issued March 2025), as amended from time to time by written notice to RGFS.

"GST" has the meaning given in the A New Tax System (Goods and Services Tax) Act 1999 (Cth).

"Insolvency Event" has the meaning given in clause 19.4.

"Key Personnel" means the individuals nominated by RGFS in accordance with clause 8.1.

"Project Brief" means a written instruction issued by AZEU to RGFS that describes a specific fieldwork task, its location, duration, and deliverables.

"Services" means the fieldwork support services described in clause 3, together with any additional services agreed in writing under a Project Brief.

"Specifications" means the technical and operational specifications set out in Schedule 1, as amended from time to time in accordance with clause 22.

"Term" means the period described in clause 2.

1.2 In this Agreement, unless the context otherwise requires:

(a) headings are for convenience only and do not affect interpretation;

(b) the singular includes the plural and vice versa;

(c) a reference to a person includes a body corporate, partnership, joint venture, association, government agency, or trust;

(d) a reference to a statute, ordinance, code, or other law includes all regulations and other instruments under it and consolidations, amendments, re-enactments, or replacements of any of them;

