(f) "including" and similar expressions are not words of limitation;

(g) "writing" includes any mode of representing or reproducing words in tangible and permanently retrievable form;

(h) where a word or phrase is given a defined meaning, any other part of speech or grammatical form of that word or phrase has a corresponding meaning;

(i) a reference to "$" or "AUD" is to Australian currency;

(j) a reference to "clause", "Schedule", or "Attachment" is to a clause of, or Schedule or Attachment to, this Agreement;

(k) a reference to a party to this Agreement includes that party's permitted successors and assigns; and

(l) a reference to a "day" is to a calendar day unless expressly stated otherwise.

**2. Commencement and Term**

2.1 This Agreement commences on the Commencement Date, being 1 July 2025, and continues for a period of twelve (12) months, unless terminated earlier in accordance with clause 19 (the "Term").

2.2 The Parties may extend the Term by written agreement executed no later than thirty (30) days prior to the expiry of the then-current Term. Any extension will be on the same terms and conditions as set out in this Agreement, except as otherwise agreed in writing.

2.3 For the avoidance of doubt, the Commencement Date is the date on which RGFS becomes entitled to commence performance of the Services, regardless of when any Project Brief is first issued.

**3. Scope of Services**

3.1 RGFS shall provide the following services to AZEU (the "Services"):

(a) **Field Logistics and Ground Support:** provision of four-wheel-drive vehicles, fuel, water, and consumables for remote fieldwork, in accordance with the Specifications;

(b) **Environmental Monitoring Assistance:** deployment and retrieval of camera traps, acoustic recorders, and other passive monitoring equipment at locations specified in Project Briefs;

(c) **Habitat Assessment Support:** assistance with vegetation transects, soil sampling, and fauna surveys under the direction of AZEU scientific staff;
